  "message": "I can check the cause of the delay and review compensation options. Please provide the flight date for HAT039 so I can look up the official delay reason. Regarding compensation: for delays, a travel certificate can be offered only if you choose to change or cancel your reservation, after I confirm the delay on your reservation. Refunds to the original payment are not provided solely for delays. Eligibility for compensation requires that you are a silver or gold member, have travel insurance, or flew business. If you want to pursue compensation, let me know whether you’d like to change or cancel and share your user id and reservation id so I can verify your details and passenger count. If you don’t want to change or cancel, please share the flight date and I’ll provide the delay reason."
